---
---

<section class="py-20 lg:py-32 bg-zinc-950 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden hidden md:block" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="orb orb-sm absolute -top-40 -right-40 w-80 h-80 bg-green-primary/15"></div>
    <div class="orb orb-sm absolute -bottom-40 -left-40 w-80 h-80 bg-green-accent/10"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="flex justify-center mb-8">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 border border-red-500/20">
        <span>&#9888;&#65039;</span> The Cost of Doing Nothing
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
        Missed Calls Are Missed <span class="gradient-green-text">Money</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-zinc-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Every day without reliable call answering can mean missed revenue.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="group relative bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-zinc-700 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 border border-red-500/20">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-400 animate-pulse"></span>
            High Risk
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight gradient-green-text mb-2">62%</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-100 mt-3">Unanswered Calls</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed mt-2 max-w-xs">
          Every missed ring is a customer buying from your competitor right now.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-zinc-700 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/20">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400 animate-pulse"></span>
            Lead Leakage
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight gradient-green-text mb-2">80%</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-100 mt-3">Instant Lead Decay</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed mt-2 max-w-xs">
          Wait more than 5 minutes to reply, and the lead is already gone forever.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-zinc-700 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 border border-red-500/20">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-400 animate-pulse"></span>
            Revenue Loss
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight gradient-green-text mb-2">$8,000+</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-100 mt-3">Lost Monthly Pipeline</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed mt-2 max-w-xs">
          On average, every business bleeds $8K+ a month by relying on voicemail.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
